# Copy this file to .env and fill in YOUR Vietmap keys.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real keys (this example file is safe).
# Keys: https://maps.vietmap.vn console -> API keys.
#
#   VIETMAP_API_KEY  = search / place / routing (autocomplete, place, route v4)
#   VIETMAP_TILE_KEY = map style + tiles (style.json?apikey=..., tiles)
#   GOOGLE_GEOCODE_KEY = Google Maps Geocoding API key (optional; far better
#                        Vietnamese search than Nominatim). Needs the Geocoding
#                        API enabled + billing in Google Cloud Console.
#   GOOGLE_PLACES_KEY  = Google Places API key (optional; BEST Vietnamese
#                        house-number address AUTOCOMPLETE + search, e.g.
#                        "62 đường 30/4"). Needs the Places API enabled +
#                        billing. Falls back to Vietmap/Photon when unset.
#
# AI assistant keys (optional). These are ONLY a dev-time fallback — the app
# prefers keys entered in-app and stored ENCRYPTED via Android Keystore /
# iOS Keychain (flutter_secure_storage). See ⚙ → Trợ lý AI.
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY = https://platform.deepseek.com (deepseek-chat)
#   GEMINI_API_KEY   = https://aistudio.google.com (gemini-2.0-flash)
#
# Usage:
#   tool/run.sh                 # flutter run with keys from .env
#   tool/build.sh               # flutter build apk --debug with keys
#   tool/build.sh --release     # release build
VIETMAP_API_KEY=
VIETMAP_TILE_KEY=
GOOGLE_GEOCODE_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACES_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
